CHAPTER III
OFFICERS OF THE UNIVERSITY
8. Officers of the University.---The
following shall be the officers of the University:
(a) Chancellor;
(b) Pro-Chancellor;
(c) Vice Chancellor;
(d) Pro-Vice Chancellor;
(e) Deans;
(f) Chairpersons;
(g) Teachers;
(h) Registrar;
(i) Treasurer;
(j) Controller of Examinations;
(k) Resident Auditor; and
(l) such other persons as may be prescribed.
